    {
      "title": "Quality of Life",
      "anchor": "Quality_of_Life",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Improvements for Party Queuing",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "If a Party Member is not available when a queue pops (e.g., they are not logged in), your Party will not join a lobby"
                },
                {
                  "text": "If a Party Member opens the Console Guide while in queue, the Party will be removed from the queue",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "This matches the behavior for a single player. We are unable to determine what a player does after they open the Guide, and if they leave the game it would result in a failed lobby."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Gameplay",
      "anchor": "Gameplay",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Global Crit Adjustment",
          "anchor": "Global_Crit_Adjustment",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "The bonus damage from a Critical Strike is now 150%. This is reduced from 165%"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Items",
          "anchor": "Items",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Typhon’s Heart",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Typhon Minion will attempt to follow back and to the left of its owner"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Typhon Minion will drop target and return to owner if too far away"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Tenacity Improvements",
          "anchor": "Tenacity_Improvements",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "This stat now also reduces the intensity/strength (but not the duration of):"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Vortices"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Fears/Taunts"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Intoxicates/Trembles"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Slows"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Knockbacks/Knockups"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Conquest Pacing, Economy, and the Jungle",
          "anchor": "Conquest_Pacing,_Economy,_and_the_Jungle",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In this update, we are taking a targeted approach to address community feedback surrounding match pacing—specifically, the feeling that matches can snowball out of control too quickly. Our overarching goal for this patch is to ensure that falling behind doesn't feel like an automatic defeat, while still heavily rewarding players who actively execute good plays."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Additionally, we are dialing back the overarching power and global influence of the Jungler role, which has been dominating the mid-game economy."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Here is a breakdown of how we are addressing these goals:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "God Balance",
      "anchor": "God_Balance",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "\"With the wide-scale updates to jungle experience and rewards, as well as adjustments to critical strike mechanics, this patch focuses on more targeted individual god and item balance changes. These address follow-up adjustments that could not be included in the previously deployed hotfix.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Apollo",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Audacity",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Aspect of Harmony",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "text": "Can no longer gain stacks of Audacity while an empowered So Beautiful is available."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Anhur",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enfeeble",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Physical Protection Reduction changed from 20 -> 5 + .75 per level"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Da Ji",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Paolao",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Duration reduced from 7s -> 5s",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "text": "(more specifically this was 5s -> 4s for the ability firing window and 2s -> 1s for the landing window)"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Gilgamesh",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
